# Build context of the TypeScript images (docker build -f apps/<name>/Dockerfile .): the workspace
# and nothing else. The .NET images use source/ as their context and are not affected.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps
!packages
**/node_modules
**/.output
**/.tanstack
**/dist
